## Highlights
1. An $\mathrm{NH}_{2}$ -Cu-MOFs with oxidase mimetic activity which can work well under a high pH value 8.0 was successfully synthesized.   
2. A ratiometric multicolor fluorescence biosensor for visualization, smartphone-based detection of ALP activity was constructed by utilizing the multifunctional $\mathrm{NH}_{2}$ -Cu-MOFs.   
3. This method didn’t require any $\mathrm{H}_{2}\mathrm{O}_{2}$ , special fluorescent probe, or expensive instruments.   
4. A smartphone-based app was programmed for ALP analysis by using a simple click.
